### ============================================
### S3 PRE-SIGNED URL ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3

@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@s3Path = /api/v1/users/s3

### ============================================
### S3 OPERATIONS
### ============================================

### Generate Pre-signed URL for File Upload
GET {{baseUrl}}{{s3Path}}/presigned-url?fileKey=uploads/profile/user-1/profile.jpg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

### Generate Pre-signed URL for File Download
GET {{baseUrl}}{{s3Path}}/presigned-url/download?fileKey=uploads/profile/user-1/profile.jpg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

